  "description": "An opinionated, secure-by-default Argon2id password hashing library for .NET 8, 9, and 10. Provides memory-hard protection against GPU/ASIC attacks with RFC 9106 / OWASP-aligned parameters, a self-describing PHC hash string format, constant-time verification, optional keyed pepper with rotation, and a clean HashPassword / VerifyPassword API designed for ASP.NET Core Identity and user registration. Trim- and Native-AOT-compatible.",
